            "Missing values after cleaning (left for in-pipeline imputation): {'age_group': 38, 'income_range': 74, 'transactions_per_month': 59, 'app_logins_per_month': 63, 'support_tickets_90d': 49, 'late_payments_6m': 48, 'investment_balance_usd': 15}\n",
