      "source": [
        "## 5. Customer risk segmentation\n",
        "Predicted churn probabilities are produced for the **held-out test customers (the scoring population)** using the selected model. Thresholds:\n",
        "* **High risk:** probability ≥ the F2-optimal threshold chosen on training OOF predictions (empirically selected).\n",
        "* **Low risk:** probability < half of that threshold (**illustrative** cut-off, not optimised).\n",
        "* **Medium risk:** in between.\n",
        "\n",
        "Note: with `class_weight=\"balanced\"` the scores are not calibrated probabilities; they are best interpreted as risk scores. Observed churn rates per tier are reported to check that the ordering is meaningful."
      ]
    },
