      "source": [
        "## 6. Customer lifetime value (LTV) prediction\n",
        "* **Target:** `ltv_12m_usd` – revenue (USD) generated over the **next 12 months** (prediction horizon = 12 months, currency = USD).\n",
        "* **Predictors:** the same 15 features available at prediction time. The churn label and the LTV target are **not** used as inputs.\n",
        "* **Models:** Ridge regression (linear baseline, L2 shrinkage handles correlated features; Hoerl & Kennard, 1970) and Random Forest Regressor, tuned by 5-fold CV on RMSE using training data only; a mean-predictor baseline is included.\n",
        "* **Caveat:** the target is simulated and depends on the latent churn event; results show the workflow, not validated financial forecasting."
      ]
    },
